    "turn_text": "Now that sort of highlights the importance of having a great designer. I know that a lot of the accelerators, 500-star-ups, tech-stars, they sort of have this formula, you know, hacker-hustler developer. So, I'm a hacker-hustler. and I'm sorry, I'm designer, sorry, it's a designer. So, you know, they stress the importance of design, and design is actually the sort of the secret sauce for a lot of these apps. So let's, one more question before I go into the other stuff, you know, Congress, because that's what you are. You know, so we have a lot of important topics to hit there, but What is going to say here? What is sort of the future of, I guess, e-commerce and sort of these commoditized items like drugs and stuff? Do you think that we're sort of in a shift in how we deliver goods? So Amazon, obviously, is a good example of that. And they're trying to open up. you know like drones and in driverless cars you think that's going to get to that level of the almost like logistics-wise. What's your opinion about that? Let's talk about the future of key commerce",
