    "turn_text": "Just so you guys know, this event is sponsored by Google 44, which is they're dedicating about 100 chapters all over the world to interview women entrepreneurs, so that's great kudos for Google. And then all the guys here in this room who are sort of nodding off, because women technology, 50% of this room is women, so you better watch out. OK, so let's talk about sort of your Congress. So I love your story of redemption. You actually, you ran for Congress 2010. but you lost. And then 2012, you ran again and you won. And it's a really amazing story of redemption. Do you think running for Congress is sort of like running a startup? Well, you can talk about the story, but I want to know if you answered that one.",
